- @page_title = "Join the Team"
.container
  .row
    .span7
      %h1.title= @page_title
      #mission
      %p
        Action.IO is revolutionizing the way the world builds applications by moving your development runtime to the cloud. We're looking for remarkable people to help us effect the next paradigm shift in programming.
      %p
        Action.IO was founded in June of 2012 and has offices in Palo Alto, California and Singapore.

      %article#jobs
        #jpost
          %h3 Dev Ops Engineer
          %p.desc
            Dev Ops are the heart of the Action.IO platform. You're an automation wizard, you've rube goldberg'ed your entire morning routine, and you're looking to take those skills elsewhere.

          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li
                BS or greater in Computer Science or related quantitative field
              %li
                You are the king of AWS (EC2+EBS+S3)
              %li
                Experience administering large scale production server environments
              %li
                Familiarity with common open source web service infrastructure:  Nginx, HAProxy, Redis, MySQL, etc;
              %li
                Ability to identify and smash performance bottlenecks
              %li
                Experience with monitoring systems and configuration management tools like Chef &amp; Puppet

